  "solution": "**Given Equation: **108 × 343 + 7 - 2 ÷ 13 = ?\n\n**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a45b5b9191c13cd4da310eb8df100becb078c240f4b0e763420ec154fb42a5fd.png] \n\n**Decoding the given information:**\n\n \n \n\n **Symbols**\n **+**\n **-**\n **×**\n **÷**\n \n \n\n **Meaning**\n **÷**\n **×**\n **-**\n **+**\n \n \n\n**New Equation: **108 - 343 ÷ 7 × 2 + 13 = ?** **\n\n108 - __**343 **____**÷**____** 7**__ × 2 + 13 = ? \n\n108 - __**49**____** ×**____** 2**__ + 13 = ? \n\n__**108**__ - 98__** + 13**__ = ? \n\n__121 - 98 __**= ?**\n\n__**23 **__= ?\n\nSo, **'23' **is the value of this expression.\n\nHence, the correct answer is ***'Option 1'.***",
